	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/interface_settings/help_strings">
		<string text="The HUD, the players' names, the scoreboard and the chat."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Draws the HUD from sharp high-resolution redraws. Off draws the game's own pictures."/>
		<string text="The buttons the HUD draws. Classic: plain Xbox buttons. Gems: shaded Xbox buttons. Dark Gems: the menus' button artwork."/>
		<string text="Your living teammates' views in the HUD's top line, with their names, shields and distances, in co-op and team games: the SPARTAN LINK key (or D-pad Down) shows and hides them. Off: the key does nothing."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="In multiplayer, whose names are drawn above their heads."/>
		<string text="How large the players' names are drawn."/>
		<string text="A team game's scoreboard: a column for each team, or every player in order of score."/>
		<string text="Draws a dark panel behind the scoreboard, for clearer text."/>
		<string text="While you wait to respawn in co-op or a team game: watch a living teammate through their eyes (A or Jump for the next), or the game's death camera."/>
		<string text="Draws a clock at the bottom right in multiplayer, counting up from the start of the game."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Shows the text chat. Hide draws none of its lines, and its keys and D-pad Up open nothing."/>
		<string text="Colors draws the names in their team's color; White draws it all white, as Custom Edition does."/>
	</strings>
</menus>
